Z||000008||FieroKyle||12-15-2001||12:37 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DaRkLoRD:<BR><B>I wouldn't buy anything from GAP/Old Navy.. (yeah, I'm one of those people who doesn't like supporting companies that I know use child labour to make their products.. the disney clothing company is worse though.. we studied that in one of my career classes in high school)<P>but d@mn, she looks good. hehe<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>I buy what I like. I am probably gonna sound like an *******  but I don't really care if those kids are working in poor conditions. Whether I buy that shirt or not is not gonna shut the whole plant down. Almost everything is made my children in harsh labor conditions. Just one of those cruel facts of life in 3rd world countries. Life goes on, can't do much about it.<BR>||||reg||1
